    "Just be for the Massachusetts COVID-19 shut down, Guild members and patrons of the arts (and good wine!) snuck in a fabulous party at Jake Rooney’s for the Guild of Harwich Artists’ Art Reception and Wine Pairing. Manager Kate and her fabulous staff treated us with care. The chef made the most wonderful exclusive menu for us (see below). At some point when the pandemic veil is lifted, be sure to visit Jake Rooney’s on Rt. 28 in Harwich for wonderful food, fun entertainment, as well as, the art will be there until June."
