  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-24ee350b4de3fb6c4205/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Gallery</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-03-27T13:07:44-04:00\" title=\"Friday, March 27, 2020, 1:07 pm\">March 27, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<div>Just be for the Massachusetts COVID-19 shut down, Guild members and patrons of the arts (and good wine!) snuck in a fabulous party at <a href=\"https://www.jakerooneys.com/\">Jake Rooney’s</a> for the Guild of Harwich Artists’ Art Reception and Wine Pairing. Manager Kate and her fabulous staff treated us with care. The chef made the most wonderful exclusive menu for us (see below). At some point when the pandemic veil is lifted, be sure to visit Jake Rooney’s on Rt. 28 in Harwich for wonderful food, fun entertainment, as well as, the art will be there until June.</div>\n<div></div>\n\n\t\t\t<div id=\"5364-1\" class=\"gallery gallery-5364 gallery-col-2 gallery-columns-2 gallery-size-large\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-d3db17a5fc1ebf132ebb/\"><img width=\"877\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/45ea1c0e30c93001c309e6c3f93b8594d65d78965df1276d741db8d5d2413569.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"Two women posing next to a leprechaun mascot.\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\"><a href=\"/archive/source-5e797b3e4e5a2e0b2d39/\"><img width=\"1024\" height=\"684\" src=\"/media/archive/2f4853dbb0e02bab282aacbb9c3397da7651cc6deb72382c4c19410435c83c88.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A group of women posing for a picture at a restaurant.\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon landscape\"><a href=\"/archive/source-1ba7be49d23f972f14db/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"601\" src=\"/media/archive/a142fb97d78db61ed8eae0a6f11407ab880d033903f6f54ed0ad8fa519131bb0.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A group of people sitting around a table at a restaurant.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-43774fd583fb4e19949e/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"650\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/c36d1bde54e52f65f090ab8a0ea562a2d0c1b3d28f55bccb7adeeb4a459bfe1b.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A menu of a restaurant.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-93ad891d9900bdfa0fea/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"812\" height=\"1024\" src=\"/media/archive/83e5610455c5a9dab55258242197611f027da51c3d196a534592cb475ae99d5a.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A man and woman sitting at a table with wine glasses.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"gallery-item col-2\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"gallery-icon portrait\"><a href=\"/archive/source-f4b2befc02199d22b2db/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" width=\"960\" height=\"980\" src=\"/media/archive/8b327d922857e2d77be222ccedda121f3f92debea6557684f00ab19b457fe4a7.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large\" alt=\"A group of people sitting at a table.\" /></a></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<footer class=\"entry-footer\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-terms category\">Posted in <a href=\"/archive/source-74004cd9be5de0d40a61/\" rel=\"tag\">EVENTS</